error[E0201]: `p` is used here, after it was moved
   --> closure_move_use_after_move.um:5:5
   |
 4 |     let f = move || p.x
 5 |     let q = p
   |     ^^^^^^^^^
 6 |     let _ = f
  = cause: moving a value of a non-Copy type leaves the original unusable
  = help: borrow `p` instead of moving it, or clone it (the replacement depends on what you meant to do)
       closure_move_use_after_move.um:5:5  let q = p ->

